OL,3,GNEWSACouncil secures grant to support
OL,4,Ayouth activities
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly #300,000 of government funding
OL,7,Fhas been secured by a council to
OL,8,Fsupport youth activities.
OL,10,FNorth Northamptonshire Council has
OL,11,Fwelcomed a #293,533 government grant
OL,12,Ffrom the Department for Digital,
OL,13,FCulture, Media and Sport.
OL,15,FThe one-off grant forms part of the
OL,16,Fgovernment's wider Youth Matters
OL,17,Fstrategy, a 10-year plan designed to
OL,18,Fensure every young person has somewhere
OL,19,Fto go, someone to turn to, and a
OL,20,Fcommunity where they feel they belong.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
