OL,3,GNEWSACouncil secures grant to support
OL,4,Ayouth activities
OL,5,
OL,6,FElizabeth Wright, the council's
OL,7,Fexecutive member for children,
OL,8,Feducation and families, said: "We want
OL,9,Four young people to have access to
OL,10,Factivities that help them build
OL,11,Fconfidence, develop new skills and
OL,12,Fcreate lasting friendships."
